Z||000001||Nashco||10-28-2001||02:02 AM||||There are a lot of folks that are great with Photoshop here on the forum.  Here's a sample of our skills:  <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20010924-1-006394.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20010924-1-006394.html</A> <P>There is a lot more that goes on with photoshop around here.  I'm sure if you post a good size version of what you want edited, there'll be someone to help you out.  It's really not that hard, just takes a little experience with photoshop and some time <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
